### Configure full page screenshot on test failure

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/blob/main/docs/src/release-notes-js.md

Enable automatic full-page screenshot capture when tests fail by configuring the screenshot mode in playwright.config.ts. This helps with debugging by providing visual context of test failures.

```javascript
import { defineConfig } from '@playwright/test';
export default defineConfig({
  use: {
    screenshot: {
      mode: 'only-on-failure',
      fullPage: true,
    }
  }
});
```

--------------------------------

### Configure Automatic Screenshot Capture in Playwright Test

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/blob/main/docs/src/test-api/class-testoptions.md

Enable automatic screenshot capture after test execution with configurable modes: 'off' (disabled), 'on' (every test), 'only-on-failure' (failures only), or 'on-first-failure' (first failure only). Supports full-page screenshots and transparency options.

```javascript
import { defineConfig } from '@playwright/test';

export default defineConfig({
  use: {
    screenshot: 'only-on-failure',
  },
});
```

--------------------------------

### Configure Recording Options in Playwright

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/blob/main/docs/src/test-use-options-js.md

Enable and configure screenshot, video, and trace recording in Playwright tests through the playwright.config.ts file. These options control when recordings are captured during test execution, with output stored in the test-results directory. Supports modes like 'only-on-failure', 'on-first-retry', and 'on' for different recording scenarios.

```typescript
import { defineConfig } from '@playwright/test';

export default defineConfig({
  use: {
    // Capture screenshot after each test failure.
    screenshot: 'only-on-failure',

    // Record trace only when retrying a test for the first time.
    trace: 'on-first-retry',

    // Record video only when retrying a test for the first time.
    video: 'on-first-retry'
  },
});
```

