### TestConfig > expect > toHaveScreenshot

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/blob/main/docs/src/test-api/class-testconfig.md

The `toHaveScreenshot` configuration within `expect` provides fine-grained control over visual regression testing. You can set an acceptable amount of pixel differences using `maxDiffPixels` or `maxDiffPixelRatio` to allow minor variations between screenshots. The `threshold` parameter controls perceived color differences using the YIQ color space, ranging from 0 (strict) to 1 (lax), with a default of 0.2. Additional options include controlling animations behavior, caret visibility, screenshot scale, and custom style paths to ensure consistent visual comparisons across different environments.

